[{"title":"落花十首 其九","author":"释函可","text":"莺啼渐急如愁别，剩蕊残枝日又昏。\n野老不知春去尽，犹将杯水奠花魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46463,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花十首 其十","author":"释函可","text":"翠袖红牙兴尚饶，蜂愁蝶散自今朝。\n年年荣落寻常事，识得春风恨便消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46464,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重哭左吏部八首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"思君不见草萋萋，日落云黄望转迷。\n未必冥途风景异，定知到处有新题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46465,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重哭左吏部八首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"历尽冰霜去不妨，从今无复歉冰霜。\n多年亲友能相见，何异生还到旧乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46466,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重哭左吏部八首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"兄弟团圞近若何，应知同和采薇歌。\n不须更话寒边事，语到寒边恨更多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46467,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重哭左吏部八首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"生前有泪三千斛，一见流人一度挥。\n地下若能开别路，好呼残魄尽将归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46468,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重哭左吏部八首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"飘零云水足深悲，最是无情泪独垂。\n人世悠悠知不问，夜台何处访相知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46469,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重哭左吏部八首 其六","author":"释函可","text":"不须重拟问高天，写尽长空也枉然。\n白日未曾听半句，于今又隔几重泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46470,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重哭左吏部八首 其七","author":"释函可","text":"如君可是忘情者，屡问曾无答一言。\n果尔不虚南面乐，招辞先拟到空门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46471,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重哭左吏部八首 其八","author":"释函可","text":"风沙漠漠竟何之，静想撚须不语时。\n道大莫嫌泉路窄，山钟佛火好相依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46472,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过山寺看芍药","author":"释函可","text":"昨日来看朵朵新，今朝几片逐飞尘。\n无情无恨还如此，休问花前坠泪人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46473,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻赤公扶病登山有怀二绝 其一","author":"释函可","text":"自笑居山懒入山，山花山鸟任閒閒。\n输君抱病仍扶杖，历尽溪流第几湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46474,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻赤公扶病登山有怀二绝 其二","author":"释函可","text":"山高雾重更多风，到处崎岖路不同。\n片石短松须歇足，莫于峰顶哭途穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46475,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤公同诸公游千山余不能从二绝 其一","author":"释函可","text":"年少探奇逸兴增，杖头常欲上云层。\n于今老病居人后，见说峰高便畏登。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46476,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤公同诸公游千山余不能从二绝 其二","author":"释函可","text":"险阻曾经百念轻，半瓢随地足平生。\n不须重话尘中路，纵是名山也懒行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46477,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"日行三万犹嫌缓，便到瑶池路亦穷。\n年老力衰甘处后，任他逐电与追风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46478,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"万仞崇冈还易上，人间最险是平康。\n若能步步如初步，历尽羊肠也不妨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46479,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"城边有路荆榛满，山上无尘虎豹多。\n健步纵留何可骋，不如随意选陂陁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46480,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"汝羸我病合相怜，山寺晨钟自在眠。\n赤汗已乾蹄已薄，长楸无复忆当年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46481,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"渥洼久已无消息，皮骨虽存志欲灰。\n旧日骁腾如梦里，莫教错认作龙媒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46482,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其六","author":"释函可","text":"惠养虽勤非素愿，茭刍苜蓿总堪羞。\n但能不受黄金络，雪碛荒阡亦自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46483,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其七","author":"释函可","text":"幸无伯乐能垂顾，价重何曾老不才。\n青草渐长溪渐溢，骐驎终欲羡驽骀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46484,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其八","author":"释函可","text":"却恨当年白马来，骅骝遍地转堪哀。\n支公久已轻神骏，只合埋头向草莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46485,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其九","author":"释函可","text":"不遇子方谁肯赎，虽然出塞不从军。\n龙鬐凤臆皆黄土，日暮临风哭旧群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46486,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示老马十首 其十","author":"释函可","text":"锦勒丝缠万骑奔，駪駪狉狉若云屯。\n何时尽放华山去，丰草长林到处恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46487,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏花六首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"一接春光即便休，莫于花底更淹留。\n从他烂漫从他落，只恐风来觌面收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46488,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏花六首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"空枝相对惬清幽，谁把繁花缀上头。\n为嘱狂风索吹尽，莫留残蕊向人愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46489,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏花六首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"岂有红颜能久驻，空庭应自长离忧。\n无端老衲花前去，分取春风一半愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46490,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏花六首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"相看到得日斜无，只恐丛空眼亦枯。\n蝶死不知花是梦，林莺何必苦招呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46491,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏花六首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"风光撇眼我明知，花信频来暗自悲。\n二十四番肠寸寸，安能更见楝花吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46492,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏花六首 其六","author":"释函可","text":"嫩蕊终当委草莱，漫劳狂雨强相催。\n空门不染犹生感，莫向朱楼绮阁开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46493,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠采郎","author":"释函可","text":"古锦为囊背不离，词臣疏草逐臣诗。\n閒同觅句来山顶，逢著山僧一局棋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46494,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻蠡云师有诗相寄未到先有此答","author":"释函可","text":"诗筒闻说寄寒边，忆别今经十六年。\n窖底雪深埋未了，馀魂飞向玉帘泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46495,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和亦公韵","author":"释函可","text":"岁尽风吹事事无，閒拈榾柮自添炉。\n山中松树枝枝雪，莫压城西那一株。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46496,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春","author":"释函可","text":"谁识山中别有春，梅花为梦草为茵。\n更馀布袋残书卷，不恨身贫恨道贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46497,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中同阿字读柱江燕歌","author":"释函可","text":"雪底燕歌不可听，千峰不见一峰青。\n几年心著寒灰死，敲碎他家老瓦瓶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46498,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆故山梅","author":"释函可","text":"不如此地雪花多，月落村头可奈何。\n翠羽无声魂已碎，梦中蝴蝶泪成河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46499,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题心公寄画山水","author":"释函可","text":"笔纤料得全无意，短短枯枝淡淡山。\n细想江南何所似，兰陵端不是云间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46500,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题谦公寄画梅","author":"释函可","text":"美人赠我一枝梅，岭上曾过十七回。\n骑马路边香不了，斜阳石压倚岩开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46501,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题天公寄画山水","author":"释函可","text":"身在山中不识山，何人泼墨寄柴关。\n雪深最好无蹊径，竟入长松大壑间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46502,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤先专普雨来及闽而返今冬阿字始至戏成二绝 其一","author":"释函可","text":"累累低冢路茫茫，普雨何曾及大荒。\n怪杀羸躯兼善病，竟将草屦试冰霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46503,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤先专普雨来及闽而返今冬阿字始至戏成二绝 其二","author":"释函可","text":"雁足先传纸半张，十年窖底伴羝羊。\n栖贤门下多龙象，蹴踏都应白玉堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46504,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏似阿字","author":"释函可","text":"只将匡岳纸三张，此外何曾半瓣香。\n江月江烟兼塞雪，等閒收拾满空囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46505,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"心公书来寄乾笋一觔不到天公书来寄乾笋一觔半又不到戏成","author":"释函可","text":"十载檀栾梦不成，此君虽死怯山行。\n自怜福薄甘心饿，犹幸书来两见名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46506,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿字破袋中见澹归书有行不得哥哥语戏成","author":"释函可","text":"曾于天外寄空音，忽听连啼烟水深。\n碛雪果然行不得，瓶窑辜负十年心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46507,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤中秋无月二绝 其一","author":"释函可","text":"雪晴夜半冷云开，缺月疑从匡顶来。\n招隐泉边应未卧，遥知两地各徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46508,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤中秋无月二绝 其二","author":"释函可","text":"似此如何得好怀，夜寒泉石亦难谐。\n却怜金井桥头影，定是吟诗忆海涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46509,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"起西以长篇寄讯答此短章","author":"释函可","text":"白门风雨读僧诗，夜半钟声动远思。\n布袋装来千斛泪，报君欲语已无辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46510,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和归宗蠡云师寄韵","author":"释函可","text":"尺幅三年到远天，泉声和泪落风前。\n何当剪烛松堂上，读尽离忧几百篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46511,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"释函可","text":"日日空山一卷书，行吟孤坐外无馀。\n清风寺里僧来到，说道明朝是岁除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46512,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五更大风至旦晴明志喜","author":"释函可","text":"积露寒沙一霎收，天恩如水向东流。\n愁心吹入关门尽，一片残云也不留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46513,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日山中寄同难诸老","author":"释函可","text":"不恨投荒我独先，春风应满塞城边。\n相将半揖辞冰雪，莫忆寒云壑底眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46514,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送尸林","author":"释函可","text":"六载寒沙共耐饥，临行双泪尚依依。\n片云莫道无归处，好向老人峰上飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46515,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄答禅人二偈 其一","author":"释函可","text":"西风吹送越江吟，百斛梅花散远林。\n扑鼻是香无觅处，漫拈片雪报高岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46516,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄答禅人二偈 其二","author":"释函可","text":"誓将寸管侍晨昏，尚有招辞及远魂。\n门下三千那不愧，几人真感信陵君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46517,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送阿字游医巫闾二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"杖历千山意未舒，又将望海上巫闾。\n秪疑绝顶云封处，犹有东丹万卷书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46518,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送阿字游医巫闾二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"嵯峨十载梦魂间，羡汝逍遥一笠閒。\n若到辽良读书处，秋游好续几篇还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46519,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻阿字诸子改从海舶还","author":"释函可","text":"草鞋脱却任乾坤，日淡云黄海气昏。\n纵遇神仙休眷恋，乘风直向虎头门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46520,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣诸子行后二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"几年无复听乡音，一听乡音泪更深。\n收拾乡音担去尽，不教细碎动予心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46521,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣诸子行后二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"东林尚不展家书，况是流离万里馀。\n从今莫管南来雁，万壑千峰意自如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46522,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜雪","author":"释函可","text":"夜寒无那自开扉，天地冥冥静有辉。\n莫学当年梅子咏，恐他持去织弓衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46523,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中怀阿字","author":"释函可","text":"雪里题诗汝最多，汝行雪里柰予何。\n只今乞食长安市，更向谁人慷慨歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46524,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀侍者","author":"释函可","text":"从师出塞一年期，几度山前暗泪滋。\n知尔旧乡情倍切，梦中白发两垂垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46525,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谭家庵","author":"释函可","text":"何处山门八字开，城西咫尺白云堆。\n但逢楖栗横担者，定是谭家庵里来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46526,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耻若新居成","author":"释函可","text":"何曾离却一步地，泥灶柴门色色新。\n四壁任教涂白雪，萧然仍是去年贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46527,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"允中老僧入山过冬","author":"释函可","text":"岁暮不知何处宿，深山雪底共围炉。\n不因满眼儿孙好，那得孤身伴老夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46528,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耻若闻十慧龙诸子入山","author":"释函可","text":"山前大路久荒芜，况复连绵雨雪铺。\n莫道有邻寒始见，长松顽石尽吾徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46529,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遥哭黄旡咎","author":"释函可","text":"当年结束九江行，无柰当年舐犊情。\n最是金多难赎命，何如孤迹任飘萍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46530,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢因翁寄夏衣","author":"释函可","text":"五月披裘自采薇，故人何处授轻衣。\n无端惹得薰风动，拂尽黄沙白日晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46531,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与季心雪","author":"释函可","text":"闻寻冰雪出边陲，一局残棋一卷诗。\n吟罢便愁田海换，何须更待烂柯时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46532,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金塔山居杂咏二十首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"长夜鸡声迥不闻，寂寥古塔与平分。\n却嫌窗外晨钟动，犹带寒风闹白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46533,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金塔山居杂咏二十首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"月出开关昼掩扉，山上人间事事违。\n最是欹崖连屋角，一番下雪一番飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46534,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金塔山居杂咏二十首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"端坐泥床何所为，雪晴日影上高枝。\n山麋野鹿全无礼，来不参堂去不辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46535,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金塔山居杂咏二十首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"云散鹤飞何所止，殿台散木长横枝。\n閒寻旧日经行处，荒草犹眠半截碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46536,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金塔山居杂咏二十首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"曲木为梁草作帘，我来又盖半间添。\n蒲团以外惟茶灶，瓦罐烧泉味亦甜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46537,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金塔山居杂咏二十首 其六","author":"释函可","text":"孤松如盖碧萋萋，流水还馀未冻溪。\n穷到生台无半粒，饥乌带雪向人啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46538,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金塔山居杂咏二十首 其七","author":"释函可","text":"耕田博饭不须贪，但看厨烟勿教断。\n今年种麦本无多，野雀公然分一半。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46539,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金塔山居杂咏二十首 其八","author":"释函可","text":"莫言山里绝无朋，渐住云间几处僧。\n八岁沙弥头带笠，驱牛一直上高层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46540,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]